msgstr "Instalação do Expect"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/expect.xml:51
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Expect needs PTYs to work.  Verify that the PTYs are working properly inside"
" the chroot environment by performing a simple test:"
msgstr ""
"Expect precisa de PTYs para funcionar. Verifique se os PTYs estão "
"funcionando corretamente dentro do ambiente chroot realizando um teste "
"simples:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/expect.xml:55
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"test\">python3 -c 'from pty import spawn; "
"spawn([\"echo\", \"ok\"])'</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"test\">python3 -c 'from pty import spawn; "
"spawn([\"echo\", \"ok\"])'</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/expect.xml:57
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This command should output <computeroutput>ok</computeroutput>.  If, "
"instead, the output includes <computeroutput>OSError: out of pty "
"devices</computeroutput>, then the environment is not set up for proper PTY "
"operation.  You need to exit from the chroot environment, read <xref "
"linkend='ch-tools-kernfs'/> again, and ensure the <systemitem "
"class=\"filesystem\">devpts</systemitem> file system (and other virtual "
"kernel file systems) mounted correctly.  Then reenter the chroot environment"
" following <xref linkend='ch-tools-chroot'/>.  This issue needs to be "
"resolved before continuing, or the test suites requiring Expect (for example"
" the test suites of Bash, Binutils, GCC, GDBM, and of course Expect itself) "
"will fail catastrophically, and other subtle breakages may also happen."
msgstr ""
"Esse comando deveria gerar <computeroutput>ok</computeroutput>. Se, em vez "
"disso, a saída gerada incluir <computeroutput>OSError: out of pty "
"devices</computeroutput>, então o ambiente não está configurado para "
"operação adequada de PTY. Você precisa sair do ambiente chroot, ler <xref "
"linkend='ch-tools-kernfs'/> novamente e garantir que o sistema de arquivos "
"<systemitem class=\"filesystem\">devpts</systemitem> (e outros sistemas de "
"arquivos virtuais do núcleo) foi montado corretamente. Em seguida, entre "
"novamente no ambiente chroot seguindo <xref linkend='ch-tools-chroot'/>. "
"Esse problema precisa ser resolvido antes de continuar ou as suítes de teste"
" que exigem o Expect (por exemplo, as suítes de teste do Bash, Binutils, "
"GCC, GDBM e, com certeza, a próprio Expect) falharão catastroficamente e "
"outras falhas sutis possivelmente também aconteçam."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/expect.xml:70
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, make some changes to allow the package with gcc-15.1 or later:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, faça algumas mudanças para permitir o pacote com gcc-15.1 ou "
"posterior:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/expect.xml:72
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../&expect-gcc15-patch;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../&expect-gcc15-patch;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/expect.xml:74
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare Expect for compilation:"
msgstr "Prepare Expect para compilação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/expect.xml:76
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --with-tcl=/usr/lib     \\\n"
"            --enable-shared         \\\n"
"            --disable-rpath         \\\n"
"            --mandir=/usr/share/man \\\n"
"            --with-tclinclude=/usr/include</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --with-tcl=/usr/lib     \\\n"
"            --enable-shared         \\\n"
"            --disable-rpath         \\\n"
"            --mandir=/usr/share/man \\\n"
"            --with-tclinclude=/usr/include</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/expect.xml:84
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the configure options:"
msgstr "O significado das opções do configure:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/expect.xml:87
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--with-tcl=/usr/lib</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--with-tcl=/usr/lib</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/expect.xml:89
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This parameter is needed to tell <command>configure</command> where the "
"<command>tclConfig.sh</command> script is located."
msgstr ""
"Esse parâmetro é necessário para dizer ao <command>configure</command> onde "
"o script <command>tclConfig.sh</command> está localizado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/expect.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--with-tclinclude=/usr/include</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--with-tclinclude=/usr/include</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/expect.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid "This explicitly tells Expect where to find Tcl's internal headers."
msgstr ""
"Isso explicitamente diz a Expect onde encontrar os cabeçalhos internos da "
"Tcl."

